Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//----------------------------TEXT----------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼...會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有可以換的...衣服嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我、我有準備了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,這時候不用想東想西的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,只要跟平常一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,希兒小姐 妳今晚就睡床上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我睡地板就...好?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,您怎麼只穿一件衣服啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因為太大件不合身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一穿就掉囉
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//----------------------------STAFF----------------------------
